# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# WebRTC calls (REQUIRED for audio to work on most networks)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Without a TURN relay, calls only connect on simple home/mobile networks.
# On symmetric NAT, corporate wifi, and carrier-grade NAT (most 4G/5G) the
# call will ring, connect, and then carry NO AUDIO, because STUN alone cannot
# find a path. A TURN relay is the fix.
# Any of these works: Cloudflare Calls TURN, Twilio, Metered, or a self-hosted
# coturn. Credentials are the short-lived ones the provider gives you.
# VITE_TURN_URL=turn:your-relay.example.com:3478
# VITE_TURN_USERNAME=nabri
# VITE_TURN_CREDENTIAL=your-shared-secret
